  "description": {
    "text": "The XY Trainer Kit: Latias & Latios, released on 29 April 2015, was the third kit of the XY Series and brought back the two Pokémon of the June 2004 EX Trainer Kit. Its Latias and Latios are the pair's first cards as Psychic types. The cards carry the kit's own set symbol and no rarity mark, numbered in the order the example battle draws them.\n\nThis set holds the Latios half deck."
  },
